  chatroom_reminder: { en: 'Discussion in progress (no fixed round cap — keep going as long as new lenses arrive). Decide the next step: invite another role to add its lens / relay the user\'s answer verbatim to the relevant role / critically press a role whose claim has unverified assumptions or weak links (see ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md critical self-review). When the discussion stops bringing NEW lenses (only elaboration/repetition/drift), do NOT end on your own — use AskUserQuestion to ask the user whether to conclude; only after the user confirms, run end + summary. If a role just asked the user a question, end your turn and wait (not silence). Otherwise do NOT end your turn silently.', zh: '讨论进行中（不限定轮数——只要还在带来新视角就继续）。请决定下一步：请另一位角色从其视角补充 / 把人类刚才的答复原样转给相关角色 / 对发言有明显未验证假设或薄弱环节的角色做批判性追问（参考 ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md 批判性自检）。当讨论已不再带来新视角（只在展开/重复/发散）时，**不要擅自收尾**——用 AskUserQuestion 问用户是否结束；用户确认后再 end + 总结。若某角色正在向人类提问，结束本轮等回复（不算静默）。其余情况不要无故静默结束。' },
